{"id":193,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"Its frail wings are so thin that one can see clear through them. However, during flight these wings exhibit the power to churn air with force enough to launch a house skyward."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Yanma is capable of seeing 360 degrees without having to move its eyes. It is a great flier that is adept at making sudden stops and turning midair. This Pokémon uses its flying ability to quickly chase down targeted prey."},{"games":["Y","HeartGold","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"If it flaps its wings really fast, it can generate shock waves that will shatter windows in the area."},{"games":["X","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"Its eyes can see 360 degrees without moving its head. It won’t miss prey--even those behind it."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"By flapping its wings at high speed, it can fly freely through the air. Even sudden stops are no problem."},{"games":["White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"It can hover in one spot by flapping its wings at high speed. It flits about to guard its territory."},{"games":["SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"Its large eyes can scan 360 degrees. It looks in all directions to seek out insects as its prey."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"It can see 360 degrees without moving its eyes. It is a great flier capable of making sudden stops and turning midair to quickly chase down targeted prey."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"It can see in all directions without moving its big eyes, helping it spot attackers and food right away."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Speed Boost","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's Speed stat is boosted every turn."},{"name":"Compound Eyes","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's compound eyes boost its accuracy."},{"name":"Frisk","hidden":true,"description":"When it enters a battle, the Pokémon can check an opposing Pokémon's held item."}],"eggGroups":["Bug"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHa